(n-1).","The three holes required by a legal move are exactly the vertices of a local ES corner."],"partial_result_analysis":[],"proof_insights":["Use inversion number of the E/S word to justify termination of reverse SE-to-ES switches."],"why_useful":"It supplies the correct structural bijection; the final proof will re-establish every step self-containedly."}]}
